      "header": "",
      "items": [
       {
        "title": "Manual fine adjustment",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Handwheels for additional manual fine adjustment of the Z and X axes, especially for the tool inspection module.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/9/csm_option_feinverstellung_69e5b6735b.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3327",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Measuring probe",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For tactile measurement of tool cutting edges.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/5/4/csm_option_messtaster_5313cb85ba.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3325",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "CNC swivel device",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>For distortion-free measurement of pitched tools such as threading tools and hobs.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/8/csm_option_cnc_schwenkeinrichtung_0fc04921b8.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3321",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Automatic length stop system »asza«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>CNC-controlled linear adjustment device for setting tools to length via stop bar. Alternatively available »as asza-red«, with which the tool length can optionally be set via the automatic rotation of the length adjustment screw (does not apply to shrink fit chucks).</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/1/csm_option_asza_32f127ae86.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3319",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Y-axis on the tower",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>Thanks to the additional Y-axis, the optics carrier can be positioned by up to ± 50 mm from the spindle center in the Y-direction under CNC control. In combination with the turning center measuring camera, this allows turning tools and multifunctional tools to be measured efficiently and with high precision and set to center height.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/6/csm_option_yachse_7a1e458de7.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3317",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "Tailstock version »phoenix«",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>The tailstock can be conveniently lowered and holds long, slim tools precisely in position with a defined contact pressure. In addition to tools, components can also be measured between centers.</p>",
          "images": [
           {
            "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/b/5/csm_option_reitstock_phoenix_249d45464d.webp",
            "alt": "",
            "w": 1000,
            "h": 563
           }
          ],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "below",
          "cols": 1,
          "valign": "top",
          "ftype": "textpic",
          "id": "c3315",
          "bg": "",
          "space": {
           "before": "default",
           "after": "default"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ],
