  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »wearCheck« </h3> <h2> Analysis of tool wear through artificial intelligence </h2>",
   "body": "<p><strong>Production-integrated wear analysis - ZOLLER shows how progress works with AI!</strong></p> <p>The »wearCheck« AI measurement function for wear analysis supports the standardized and automated assessment of tool condition based on image processing methods. The software provides a reliable analysis during tool preparation - without additional time expenditure!</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/03_Media_Press/Downloads/Automation/ZOLLER_Flyer_KI_wearCheck_FLWEARCHECK_00_EN_07.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Brochure »wearCheck«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/c/csm_wearCheck_07f0151f53.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1002
    }
   ],
